<h1 style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;">Link Expiration</h1>
<p>Set links to automatically expire on a specific date and time. After expiration, visitors are redirected to a fallback URL.</p>

<h2>Setting an Expiration</h2>
<ol><li>When creating or editing a link, set the <strong>Expires At</strong> date/time</li><li>Optionally set an <strong>Expiration URL</strong> — where users go after the link expires</li><li>If no expiration URL is set, users are redirected to your workspace's default redirect URL</li></ol>

<h2>Use Cases</h2>
<ul><li><strong>Limited-time offers:</strong> Sale links that auto-expire</li><li><strong>Event registrations:</strong> Close signups after the event</li><li><strong>Seasonal campaigns:</strong> Holiday promotions that disable automatically</li><li><strong>Content embargoes:</strong> Press releases with timed access</li></ul>
